{"id":"b2","level":3,"levelName":"Ulpan Bet","n":2,"of":9,"title":"Having","titleHe":"יֵשׁ לִי","goal":"Say what you have — Hebrew has no verb for it.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"There is no verb to have. You say there is to me: יֵשׁ לִי, and for the negative אֵין לִי, there isn't to me."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"יֵשׁ לִי סֵפֶר.","en":"I have a book."},{"he":"יֵשׁ לָהּ שְׁתֵּי אֲחָיוֹת.","en":"She has two sisters."},{"he":"אֵין לָנוּ זְמַן.","en":"We don't have time."},{"he":"יֵשׁ לְךָ דַּקָּה?","en":"Have you got a minute?"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"The thing owned is the grammatical subject, so nothing agrees with the owner. יֵשׁ never changes shape — only the לְ after it does."}],"vocab":[{"he":"זְמַן","en":"time","translit":"zman"},{"he":"כֶּסֶף","en":"money","translit":"kesef"},{"he":"עֲבוֹדָה","en":"work, job","translit":"avoda"},{"he":"חָבֵר","en":"friend (m.)","translit":"chaver"},{"he":"חֲבֵרָה","en":"friend (f.)","translit":"chavera"},{"he":"אָח","en":"brother","translit":"ach"},{"he":"אָחוֹת","en":"sister","translit":"achot"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["Hebrew","roof","time","our"],"correct":2,"prompt":"זְמַן","translit":"zman"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["land, country","to come","to go","money"],"correct":3,"prompt":"כֶּסֶף","translit":"kesef"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["work, job","house","at all, in general","small"],"correct":0,"prompt":"עֲבוֹדָה","translit":"avoda"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["book","friend (m.)","when (literary)","root"],"correct":1,"prompt":"חָבֵר","translit":"chaver"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["eats","friend (f.)","money, silver","always"],"correct":1,"prompt":"חֲבֵרָה","translit":"chavera"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["goes, walks","brother","mother","mouth"],"correct":1,"prompt":"אָח","translit":"ach"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["thing, word","buys","knows, is acquainted with","sister"],"correct":3,"prompt":"אָחוֹת","translit":"achot"},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["חֲבֵרָה","אָח","אָחוֹת","כֶּסֶף"],"correct":3,"say":"כֶּסֶף","he":true},{"type":"match","pairs":[["חֲבֵרָה","friend (f.)"],["אָחוֹת","sister"],["חָבֵר","friend (m.)"],["אָח","brother"],["זְמַן","time"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “friend (m.)”?","options":["חָבֵר","שֶׁלָּךְ","וַיֵּלֶךְ","בֵּן"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “time”?","options":["שֻׁלְחָן","זְמַן","עֶרֶב","אָז"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “brother”?","options":["אָח","לָכֵן","אֲשֶׁר","שֶׁ"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אָח","חֲבֵרָה","אָחוֹת","זְמַן"],"correct":1,"say":"חֲבֵרָה","he":true},{"type":"read","he":"עֲבוֹדָה","translit":"avoda","en":"work, job"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “sister”?","options":["אוּלַי","אֵינֶנִּי","אַף אֶחָד","אָחוֹת"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["כֶּסֶף","חָבֵר","עֲבוֹדָה","אָח"],"correct":3,"say":"אָח","he":true}]}